WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.464
Priya: Found it. The second node can't drain either.

2
00:00:04.464 --> 00:00:08.376
Sam: Why? The first one drained fine.

3
00:00:08.376 --> 00:00:13.992
Priya: The PDB is blocking the drain. We're at minimum replicas.

4
00:00:13.992 --> 00:00:19.632
Sam: So it's not the upgrade at all. It's the disruption budget.

5
00:00:19.632 --> 00:00:25.296
Priya: Right. And the readiness probe is too aggressive on that service.

6
00:00:25.296 --> 00:00:27.144
Sam: Aggressive how?

7
00:00:27.144 --> 00:00:33.072
Priya: Two-second timeout. The probe itself is killing them before they warm up.

8
00:00:33.072 --> 00:00:36.480
Sam: That would explain the restarts we saw.

9
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:41.016
Priya: Yeah. Who's picking this up — me or you?

10
00:00:41.016 --> 00:00:45.624
Sam: You take the probe. I'll own the PDB change.

11
00:00:45.624 --> 00:00:50.208
Priya: Deal. And I'll take point on the whole rollout.

12
00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:54.960
Sam: Good. Let's write both up before we retry.

